name     description
[delay]  add extra execution cycles to an instruction
in       shift data into the input shift register
irq      set, clear or wait for an interrupt
jmp      jump to another instruction
mov      copy data between registers
out      shift data out of the output shift register
pull     ISR → RX FIFO
push     TX FIFO → OSR
set      set a register or output pins
side     instruction modifier: set the side-set pin value
wait     wait for a specific pin or IRQ state
